docs {
  GOAWAY with lastStreamID below this stream, so the server never processed it (RFC 9113 §8.7 says it's safe to retry). The POC does **not** retry, so expect a clear error. A transparent retry would be even better; note what you see. h2 only; on HTTP/1.1 the server returns 400.
  
  > **Outcome case.** This request may fail *by design*. Its result is recorded in the runtime var `outcome` and asserted by the next request, **↳ verify: GOAWAY refusing this stream**. Run both together (the folder runner does this).
}
